 ![Debug Contracts tab](https://github.com/scaffold-eth/scaffold-eth-2/assets/55535804/b237af0c-5027-4849-a5c1-2e31495cccb1)
 
+## USDC Staker
+
+Stake USDC on Base (`0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`) and withdraw the full position any time. UI lives at `/stake`.
+
+- Contract: `packages/hardhat/contracts/Staker.sol` (no owner, no rewards)
+- Deploy script: `packages/hardhat/deploy/00_deploy_staker.ts` — uses real USDC on Base / Base Sepolia, deploys `MockUSDC` (6 decimals, "USD Coin"/"USDC") on the local chain only
+
+Known limits: Circle can blacklist the Staker or pause USDC, which would freeze staked funds. USDC sent straight to the contract (without `stake`) is not credited and cannot be recovered.
+
+**Local dev**
+
+1. In `packages/nextjs/scaffold.config.ts` set `targetNetworks: [chains.hardhat]`
+2. `yarn chain`, `yarn deploy`, `yarn start`
+3. Mint test USDC to your burner address via `MockUSDC.mint` on the Debug Contracts page (amounts have 6 decimals: `1000000` = 1 USDC). Get ETH for gas from the header faucet.
+
+**Production (Base)**
+
+1. `yarn deploy --network base` (generates `deployedContracts.ts` entry for chain 8453), then `yarn verify --network base`
+2. Keep `targetNetworks: [chains.base]` and set your own `NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID`
+
